module 'P2 LEDs' Output
author 'MicroBlocks community'
version 1 0
description 'Candidate firmware required; not in the reviewed revision-8 installer. Optional WS2812 RGB strip. Explicit user pin, 1-128 pixels. No output until update. Brightness 0-255 scales retained colors. RGBW unsupported. Firmware peripheral revision 1 required; hardware acceptance pending.'

spec ' ' 'p2LEDInit' 'P2 WS2812 init pin _ pixels _' 'num num' 8 8
spec ' ' 'p2LEDSet' 'P2 LED _ color _' 'num color' 1 16711680
spec ' ' 'p2LEDFill' 'P2 LEDs fill _' 'color' 0
spec ' ' 'p2LEDBrightness' 'P2 LEDs brightness _ (0-255)' 'num' 32
spec ' ' 'p2LEDUpdate' 'P2 LEDs update'

to p2LEDInit pin count { '[display:p2LEDInit]' pin count }
to p2LEDSet index color { '[display:p2LEDSet]' index color }
to p2LEDFill color { '[display:p2LEDFill]' color }
to p2LEDBrightness value { '[display:p2LEDBrightness]' value }
to p2LEDUpdate { '[display:p2LEDUpdate]' }
